This product bundles and serves the Swagger UI (Apache License 2.0).
The Swagger UI assets are vendored/embedded via the Go module
github.com/swaggo/http-swagger (which embeds the official
swagger-ui-dist release). The Swagger UI is Copyright SmartBear Software
and contributors and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The Swagger UI is served
unauthenticated at /docs/ for operator/consumer API discovery.

The OpenAPI specification served at /openapi.{yaml,json} is
code-generated from in-source annotations by the swaggo/swag CLI
(dev/CI tool, not a runtime dependency) and committed under
internal/web/api/.

